<title>USA: Continental Airlines to cut winter fares.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines to cut winter fares.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc Monday said it cut winter fares by up to 50 percent to certain domestic and international markets, including Europe, Canada and Mexico.</p>
<p>The fare cuts for domestic travel January 6 through March 15, except for travel to and from Florida, which applies January 6 through February 12, follows fare cuts announced earlier Monday by Delta Air Lines Inc.</p>
